# Detection: Repeated Local Logon Failures
# ATT&CK: T1110 (Brute Force)
# Description: Flags 3 or more failed local logon attempts (EventCode 4625)
# matching a specific fingerprint (Logon_Process=User32, source 127.0.0.1)
# within a 1-minute window. Built around a real limitation discovered during
# investigation: on this host, neither PIN nor password-based failures
# reliably attribute to a real username, so this detects the repeated-failure
# pattern itself rather than filtering by account.

index=main host="DESKTOP-HJSIADG" sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625 Logon_Process=User32 Source_Network_Address="127.0.0.1"
| bucket _time span=1m
| stats count as failure_count by _time, host
| where failure_count >= 3